Huawei Unlock Tool — Linux port
===============================

This is a Linux port (Avalonia/.NET) of the "Huawei-Unlock-Tool" originally
written for Windows (WinForms). It is a derivative work and is distributed under
the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE), consistent with the
licences of the works it is based on.

