What this port does NOT redistribute
------------------------------------
The original Windows project bundled third-party proprietary binaries
(Qualcomm emmcdl.exe / fh_loader.exe, the QMSL libraries, and Huawei partition
images). None of those are included here. The Qualcomm flashing helpers are
invoked as external programs resolved from $PATH (see the packaging/ PKGBUILDs
for emmcdl and fh_loader), not shipped in this repository.

